# .hq unified store: work/ is regenerable output, runtime/ is session state,
# locks, logs, and anything sensitive. community/ and config/ stay tracked
# (store-spec §3, §5). The `**/` prefix is required because anchors nest.
**/.hq/work/
**/.hq/runtime/

# --- Code-graph indexes ---
# Build artifacts: megabytes, regenerated from source, and stale the moment
# someone else commits. The IGNORE files that configure them (.graphifyignore)
# are configuration and stay tracked.
#
# 2026-08-31: 136 AST-cache entries (4.1 MB) were tracked here, keyed by a
# graphify version directory (`cache/ast/v0.9.48-s2/`), so every graphify
# upgrade rewrote the whole set on one machine and conflicted on the next.
# The AST pass is tree-sitter -- free and seconds -- so there is nothing to
# share. Only a *paid* semantic cache is worth tracking, and this repo has
# none; if one is ever built here, un-ignore it the way the obsidian vault
# does (`.graphify/*` + `!.graphify/cache/`, never `.graphify/` + a negation --
# git cannot revive a child of an excluded directory).
.graphify/
graphify-out/
